    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88829" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσγρᾰφ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>added to a list</i>,=Lat.
				<i>adscripticius</i>, opposed to the citizens originally
			enrolled, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.56
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πέρσης τῶν π</span>., a
			category of persons in Egypt (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιγονή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.879.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				1436.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσγραφον ἔδωκε τῆς
				τιμῆς</span>
			<i>note</i> or <i>bill</i> of the price, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.832a
			</span></i>: generally, <i>supplementary document,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				513.34
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				457.1
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.</div>
